Standards implemented (IETF): RFC 5321 (sections 2.4 and 5.1), RFC 7505,
RFC 1035 (section 4.1.1), RFC 2308 (section 5). RFC 2606 and RFC 6761 name the
reserved domains the test fixtures use.

Reference: F. J. Damerau, "A technique for computer detection and correction
of spelling errors", Communications of the ACM 7(3), 1964 (the edit
operations behind optimal string alignment).
